note top of CMD : Boot request recognized
note top of CMD@18 : Boot request\ncomplete

note bottom of DAT1_7@6 : Optional

highlight 0:4 #transparent : N_CP
highlight 5:10 #transparent : t_BA
highlight 5:15 #transparent : t_BD
highlight 12:14 #transparent : N_AC
highlight 16:17 #transparent : N_ST
highlight 16:18 #transparent : N_CD

@enduml